    "body": "Thank you for your answer.\r\nI use imagedata to change each pixel color. \r\nI don't use canvas so i convert base64 by using png encoder and Buffer.from () api.\r\nBut this operations consume performance a lot especially as big size image.\r\nAnd I think even tough i use canvas.toBlob() and createObjectURL(), it also consume too much performance.\r\nSo I want to set imagedata as img src directly.",
