    "body": "I think if it is possible to use image data directly, not converting base64, \r\nit will provide more usability, in particular, if you need to change the color of the image in real time.\r\nIf i set base64 as image src, deconding and extracting raw image data will done inside the framework.\r\nBut it is possible to use image data directly, deconding and extracting raw image data are not needed.\r\nSo it will save performance.",
